# Scene1-5-3

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐5-3
; ========================================

; ========================================
; ＞『殺人現場』を選択
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:310_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回到了案发现场，也就是审判庭，<br>决定调查奈叶香的尸体。|#0105Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（必须要先调查这里才行……）|#0105Adv03_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才艾玛差点被处刑的地方，<br>正横亘着奈叶香的尸体。|#0105Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香到底是不是被人杀害的呢……<br>光看外表看不出来呢。|#0105Adv03_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……为什么连奈叶香小姐都……<br>这种日子到底要持续到什么时候……|#0105Adv03_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……大概要持续到所有人都死光吧。<br>不过我可不会死。<br>我一定要活到最后……|#0105Adv03_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛瞥了一眼在稍远处交谈的少女们，<br>走近奈叶香的尸体。|#0105Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ナノカの死体写真』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:5-13
@UpdateWitchBook Id:5-13 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:"（和玛格说的一样，<br>　没有明显外伤，死因不明……）|#0105Adv03_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（表面有些冻结的痕迹……<br>　是冻死……？不，不可能）|#0105Adv03_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（还没有证据能证明是冻死。<br>　再仔细调查一下吧）|#0105Adv03_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论经历多少次都不可能习惯。<br>艾玛强忍着抗拒的心情，<br>用颤抖的双手仔细检查奈叶香的尸体。|#0105Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他三名少女聚在一起，<br>只是默默地看着艾玛行动。|#0105Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们脸上写满了摇摆不定，<br>一副不知是该帮助艾玛，还是该怀疑艾玛的样子。|#0105Adv03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时，梅露露下定决心，向前一步，<br>站在了艾玛身边。|#0105Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，我也来帮忙……|#0105Adv03_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露……谢谢你。|#0105Adv03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一道谢，<br>梅露露就好像要哭出来似的。|#0105Adv03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要感谢我……<br>我又胆小、又爱哭，所以……|#0105Adv03_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很讨厌这样的自己……|#0105Adv03_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的手轻轻碰触艾玛的膝盖。|#0105Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是刚才险些被处刑，看守准备拘禁艾玛的时候，<br>因为挣扎导致受了些皮外伤。|#0105Adv03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（原来受伤了啊，我自己都没发现……）|#0105Adv03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:膝盖附近升起一股暖流，<br>擦伤慢慢消失了。|#0105Adv03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧紧握住梅露露发光的手，<br>微笑着说。|#0105Adv03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和梅露露相遇的那天，<br>你也是像这样，帮我治疗了呢。|#0105Adv03_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且审判过程中也一直支持着我。<br>其实我一直都在被梅露露拯救。|#0105Adv03_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，不要责怪自己。|#0105Adv03_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的话，梅露露咬着嘴唇，<br>强忍着随时都要哭出来的冲动。|#0105Adv03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露掌心的温暖<br>似乎给艾玛带来了力量。|#0105Adv03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……根据我的调查，<br>奈叶香小姐果然还是死因不明……|#0105Adv03_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:口腔里看起来有伤，<br>但又不像是致命伤……|#0105Adv03_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……有很多令人费解之处，<br>更不知道她到底是怎么死的……|#0105Adv03_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一边说着，一边检查奈叶香尸体，<br>这时忽然在奈叶香口袋里发现了一张折叠着的小小纸条。|#0105Adv03_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『メモ』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:5-8
@UpdateWitchBook Id:5-8 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是……？）|#0105Adv03_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:纸条上潦草地写着<br>【169231】这样一串数字。|#0105Adv03_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是暗号？难道是指向凶手的线索？）|#0105Adv03_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然想不明白，<br>但看起来可能是重要线索，<br>所以还是收了起来。|#0105Adv03_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……这是……<br>　她指尖上沾着一点点血）|#0105Adv03_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的指尖虽然没有伤口，<br>但却沾着轻微血迹。|#0105Adv03_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……这到底是什么呢）|#0105Adv03_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……之后又调查了一会，<br>但没有发现其他线索。|#0105Adv03_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

