[PrintTextModified Text:有些地方我想去看看，<br>所以我现在打算去调查其他地方。|#0105Adv03_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛这么说着，<br>可可就一脸不情愿地走了过来。|#0105Adv03_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那，<br>就由我来陪同艾玛亲……|#0105Adv03_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:好。我们就留在这里。<br>——艾玛。|#0105Adv03_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛突然被玛格喊住，<br>于是猛地抬头看向她。|#0105Adv03_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Angry1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:对你来说，<br>这一定是最后一次审判了。|#0105Adv03_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说过，不会让任何人死去，<br>大家会一起逃出监牢，对吧。|#0105Adv03_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就让我好好看看你的本事吧。|#0105Adv03_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格从容地微笑着，<br>用挑战的视线煽动着艾玛。|#0105Adv03_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

